    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add To Wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1753135714\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dirty Business</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the criminal underworld and build your empire. Manage illegal operations like drug dealing, counterfeit money, arms trafficking, and theft while hiding behind legitimate businesses. Complete trade missions, expand operations, and rise to become the city's most feared crime lord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/0d808ca0645e02c7296ee051f2adf991.poster.avif?t=1753135714\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/0d808ca0645e02c7296ee051f2adf991.webm?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/0d808ca0645e02c7296ee051f2adf991.mp4?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Form Your Gang</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit street gangs and outcasts to build a powerful crew. A larger, skilled team ensures dominance in mafia battles and boosts your operations. With a strong gang, increase efficiency, production, and secure your place as the city's most formidable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/d8b4d382facc3bee240e9612948d4c43.poster.avif?t=1753135714\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/d8b4d382facc3bee240e9612948d4c43.webm?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/d8b4d382facc3bee240e9612948d4c43.mp4?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clashes and Heists</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize rival mafia territories, raid their businesses, and steal resources for your empire. Battle for essential supplies like drugs, arms, and cash. Each victory takes you closer to becoming the ultimate crime boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/96f5d4b905ad24456766b9f891505f28.poster.avif?t=1753135714\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/96f5d4b905ad24456766b9f891505f28.webm?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/96f5d4b905ad24456766b9f891505f28.mp4?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over territories and eliminate rival mafias. Expand your reign, defeat the city's top cartel, and secure your throne as the undisputed leader of the underworld. Rule the city with power and fear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/121b8a13d8571e6cefc46db98f4beeb2.poster.avif?t=1753135714\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/121b8a13d8571e6cefc46db98f4beeb2.webm?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/121b8a13d8571e6cefc46db98f4beeb2.mp4?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dirty Business</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the criminal underworld and build your empire. Manage illegal operations like drug dealing, counterfeit money, arms trafficking, and theft while hiding behind legitimate businesses. Complete trade missions, expand operations, and rise to become the city's most feared crime lord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/0d808ca0645e02c7296ee051f2adf991.poster.avif?t=1753135714\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/0d808ca0645e02c7296ee051f2adf991.webm?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/0d808ca0645e02c7296ee051f2adf991.mp4?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Form Your Gang</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit street gangs and outcasts to build a powerful crew. A larger, skilled team ensures dominance in mafia battles and boosts your operations. With a strong gang, increase efficiency, production, and secure your place as the city's most formidable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/d8b4d382facc3bee240e9612948d4c43.poster.avif?t=1753135714\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/d8b4d382facc3bee240e9612948d4c43.webm?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/d8b4d382facc3bee240e9612948d4c43.mp4?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clashes and Heists</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize rival mafia territories, raid their businesses, and steal resources for your empire. Battle for essential supplies like drugs, arms, and cash. Each victory takes you closer to becoming the ultimate crime boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/96f5d4b905ad24456766b9f891505f28.poster.avif?t=1753135714\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/96f5d4b905ad24456766b9f891505f28.webm?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/96f5d4b905ad24456766b9f891505f28.mp4?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take over territories and eliminate rival mafias. Expand your reign, defeat the city's top cartel, and secure your throne as the undisputed leader of the underworld. Rule the city with power and fear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/121b8a13d8571e6cefc46db98f4beeb2.poster.avif?t=1753135714\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/121b8a13d8571e6cefc46db98f4beeb2.webm?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409990/extras/121b8a13d8571e6cefc46db98f4beeb2.mp4?t=1753135714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Conquer the city in Gangster Boss Simulator! Build your criminal empire by producing drugs, crafting weapons, and trading illegal goods. Rise from a small-time gangster to a feared gang boss in this thrilling open-world experience. Seize power, dominate territories, and rule the streets!",
